---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — DeveX Tools" description="Learn about DeveX Tools — who we are, how we research developer tools, and why our content is independent.">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 32px; max-width: 740px; margin: 40px auto;">
    <h1 class="page-title">About DeveX Tools</h1>
    
    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <strong>DeveX Tools</strong> is an independent developer tool resource and comparison site. 
        We research and organize IDEs, CI/CD platforms, version control systems, API tools, 
        and every other piece of software that crosses a developer's desk.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Most "developer tool reviews" online are either marketing fluff paid for by vendors, or shallow 
        listicles with no substance. We take a different approach: every entry on this site is compiled 
        by our editorial team from official documentation, vendor-published information, and publicly 
        available data — organized into clear, verifiable feature lists and comparisons you can act on.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Our content is written and reviewed by the <strong>DeveX editorial team</strong>. We do not 
        fabricate individual author bylines, and we do not publish scores or ratings we cannot verify. 
        When we present a feature, a price, or a license, it comes from the tool's own documentation 
        or public records at the time of writing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;">Our Editorial Principles</h2>
      <ul style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>No sponsored placements.</strong> Zero. Tools earn their spot on our lists based on merit, not marketing budget.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Verifiable information.</strong> Feature lists, pricing, and licensing details are sourced from official documentation and public data — not invented for the sake of a review.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>No fabricated scores.</strong> We don't assign star ratings we can't justify. Instead, we give you the facts — features, pricing, and tradeoffs — so you can decide for yourself.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Living references.</strong> We update entries as tools evolve. Since launching in 2026, we regularly refresh listings as new versions and features ship.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;">Contact</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Questions, suggestions, or tool recommendations? 
        Reach out at <a href="mailto:info@devex-tools.net">info@devex-tools.net</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
